      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "How long are we talking about?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:31",
      "end_timestamp": "00:34",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I've had it for about a week. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:35",
      "end_timestamp": "00:51",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:53",
      "end_timestamp": "00:58",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "A five out of ten, I suppose. It's worse with stairs. It happens a couple of times a week. I just want to get back to normal, really.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:59",
      "end_timestamp": "01:15",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Oh, as for having put on weight, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. I've been feeling tired too, for about three months.",
